---
// About — Sunbright Recovery Center
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>About Us — Sunbright Recovery Center</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Learn about Sunbright Recovery Center — a community-founded 16-bed residential recovery center preparing to open in Red Bluff, CA, built by people with 20+ years in addiction treatment."/>
  <meta name="robots" content="index,follow"/>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png"/>
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png"/>
  <meta property="og:type" content="website"/>
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="Sunbright Recovery Center"/>
  <meta property="og:title" content="About Us — Sunbright Recovery Center"/>
  <meta property="og:description" content="Learn about Sunbright Recovery Center — a community-founded 16-bed residential recovery center preparing to open in Red Bluff, CA, built by people with 20+ years in addiction treatment."/>
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://www.sunbrightrecovery.org/about"/>
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://www.sunbrightrecovery.org/images/facility-wide.jpg"/>
  <meta property="og:image:alt" content="Sunbright Recovery Center, Red Bluff, CA"/>
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin/>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Dancing+Script:wght@600;700&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,600&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
    :root{
      --navy:#1a2e5a;--navy-dk:#101d3a;--navy-mid:#254080;--navy-lt:#edf1fa;
      --gold:#c8900a;--gold-lt:#f0c040;--gold-pale:#fdf5e0;--gold-bg:#fef9ee;
      --cream:#ede4d0;--cream-dk:#ddd2b8;--white:#fff;
      --text:#1a2438;--mid:#3d4a5c;--soft:#6b7a8d;--border:#e2d9c8;
    }
    html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
    body{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;color:var(--text);background:var(--white);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;line-height:1.6}
    h1,h2,h3,h4{font-family:'Lora',Georgia,serif;line-height:1.2}
    a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
    img{display:block;max-width:100%}
    .wrap{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px}

    /* NAV */
    nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;background:transparent;backdrop-filter:none;border-bottom:1px solid transparent;box-shadow:none;transition:background .3s,backdrop-filter .3s,border-color .3s,box-shadow .3s}
    nav.nav-scrolled{background:rgba(255,255,255,.97);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);box-shadow:0 2px 20px rgba(26,46,90,.08)}
    .nav-in{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px;display:flex;align-items:center;height:110px;overflow:hidden;gap:0}
    .nav-in img{height:108px;width:auto;flex-shrink:0;filter:brightness(0) invert(1);opacity:.95;transition:filter .3s,opacity .3s}
    nav.nav-scrolled .nav-in img{filter:none;opacity:1}
    .nav-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;margin-left:20px}
    .nav-links a{padding:8px 16px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,.9);transition:all .2s;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
    .nav-links a svg{width:16px;height:16px;flex-shrink:0;opacity:.8}
    .nav-links a:hover,.nav-links a.active{color:var(--gold-lt);background:rgba(255,255,255,.1)}
    .nav-links a:hover svg,.nav-links a.active svg{opacity:1}
    nav.nav-scrolled .nav-links a{color:var(--navy)}
    nav.nav-scrolled .nav-links a:hover,nav.nav-scrolled .nav-links a.active{color:#a87008;background:var(--navy-lt)}
    .nav-cta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;background:#fff;color:var(--navy);padding:11px 20px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;border:none;box-shadow:none;transition:all .25s;margin-left:auto}
    .nav-cta:hover{background:var(--cream);color:var(--navy-dk);transform:translateY(-1px)}
    nav.nav-scrolled .nav-cta{background:var(--gold);color:#fff}
    nav.nav-scrolled .nav-cta:hover{background:#a87008}

    /* PAGE HEADER */
    .page-header{padding:160px 0 72px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--navy-dk) 0%,var(--navy) 60%,#254080 100%);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
    .page-header::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-80px;right:-80px;width:500px;height:500px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse,rgba(200,144,10,.1),transparent 65%);pointer-events:none}
    .page-header::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--gold-lt),transparent)}
    .ph-eyebrow{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-lt);margin-bottom:10px;display:block}
    .ph-h1{font-size:clamp(32px,4.5vw,52px);color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.1}
    .ph-h1 em{font-style:italic;color:var(--gold-lt)}
    .ph-sub{font-size:16px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);line-height:1.75;max-width:560px}

    /* FOUNDER */
    .founder{padding:72px 0;background:var(--white);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
    .founder-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:56px;align-items:center}
    @media(max-width:760px){.founder-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
    .eyebrow{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:14px;display:block}
    .founder-text h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,36px);color:var(--navy);letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:20px}
    .founder-text p{font-size:15px;color:var(--mid);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:14px}
    .founder-text p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
    .founder-creds{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:24px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
    .founder-badge{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--navy);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0}
    .founder-badge svg{width:22px;height:22px;color:var(--gold-lt)}
    .founder-creds-text strong{display:block;font-size:14px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:700}
    .founder-creds-text span{font-size:12px;color:var(--soft)}
    .founder-quote{background:var(--navy);border-radius:20px;padding:36px 40px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
    .founder-quote::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-40px;right:-40px;width:200px;height:200px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse,rgba(200,144,10,.15),transparent 65%)}
    .fq-mark{font-family:'Lora',serif;font-size:80px;color:var(--gold-lt);line-height:.8;display:block;margin-bottom:8px;opacity:.6;position:relative}
    .founder-quote blockquote{font-family:'Lora',Georgia,serif;font-size:16px;font-style:italic;color:rgba(255,255,255,.9);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:20px;position:relative}
    .founder-quote cite{font-size:12.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);font-style:normal;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.05em;display:block}
    .founder-quote .fq-heal{font-family:'Dancing Script',cursive;font-size:18px;color:var(--gold-lt);margin-top:14px;display:block}

    /* ABOUT SECTION */
    .about-story{padding:72px 0;background:var(--cream)}
    .about-story-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:56px;align-items:start}
    @media(max-width:760px){.about-story-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
    .about-story h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,36px);color:var(--navy);letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:20px}
    .about-story p{font-size:15px;color:var(--mid);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:14px}
    .about-story p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
    .stats-col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px}
    .stat-card{background:var(--white);border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:22px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px);transition:opacity .6s ease,transform .6s ease,box-shadow .25s ease,border-color .25s ease}
    .stats-col.in .stat-card{opacity:1;transform:none}
    .stats-col.in .stat-card:nth-child(2){transition-delay:.08s}
    .stats-col.in .stat-card:nth-child(3){transition-delay:.16s}
    .stats-col.in .stat-card:nth-child(4){transition-delay:.24s}
    .stats-col.in .stat-card:nth-child(5){transition-delay:.32s}
    .stats-col.in .stat-card:nth-child(6){transition-delay:.40s}
    .stats-col.in .stat-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(26,46,90,.1);border-color:var(--gold-lt);transition-delay:0s}
    .stat-icon{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:11px;background:var(--navy-lt);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0}
    .stat-icon svg{width:20px;height:20px;color:var(--navy)}
    .stat-num{font-family:'Lora',serif;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);display:block;line-height:1}
    .stat-label{font-size:12px;color:var(--soft);margin-top:2px;display:block}

    /* MISSION */
    .mission{padding:72px 0;background:var(--navy);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
    .mission::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-60px;right:-60px;width:400px;height:400px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse,rgba(200,144,10,.08),transparent 65%)}
    .mission::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--gold-lt),transparent)}
    .mission-head{max-width:640px;margin-bottom:48px;position:relative}
    .mission-eyebrow{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-lt);margin-bottom:12px;display:block}
    .mission-head h2{font-size:clamp(28px,3.5vw,42px);color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:14px}
    .mission-head p{font-size:15px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);line-height:1.75}
    .mission-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;position:relative;margin-bottom:36px}
    @media(max-width:760px){.mission-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
    .mission-card{background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:16px;padding:28px 24px}
    .mission-icon{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:11px;background:rgba(240,192,64,.12);border:1px solid rgba(240,192,64,.2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:18px}
    .mission-icon svg{width:20px;height:20px;color:var(--gold-lt)}
    .mission-card h3{font-family:'Lora',serif;font-size:17px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px}
    .mission-card p{font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.45);line-height:1.7}
    .mission-note{font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.35);line-height:1.7;font-style:italic;position:relative;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)}

    /* WHY SUNBRIGHT */
    .why{padding:72px 0;background:var(--white)}
    .why-head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:52px}
    .why-divider{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:18px}
    .why-divider .line{width:80px;height:1.5px;background:var(--gold);border-radius:1px}
    .why-eyebrow{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:8px;display:block}
    .why-head h2{font-size:clamp(28px,3.5vw,42px);color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:10px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
    .why-head .sub{font-size:16px;color:var(--soft)}
    .why-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:0;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;position:relative}
    @media(max-width:760px){.why-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1px;background:var(--border)}}
    .why-card{position:relative;padding:20px 36px 24px;text-align:left;border-left:1px solid rgba(200,144,10,.18)}
    .why-card:first-child{border-left:none;padding-left:8px}
    .why-card:last-child{padding-right:8px}
    .why-numeral{position:absolute;top:-20px;left:24px;font-family:'Lora',serif;font-size:120px;font-weight:700;color:var(--gold);opacity:.12;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.04em;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;font-style:italic}
    .why-card:first-child .why-numeral{left:0}
    .why-card-content{position:relative;z-index:1}
    .why-icon{width:54px;height:54px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:22px;color:var(--gold);background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(240,192,64,.18) 0%,rgba(240,192,64,.05) 100%);border-radius:14px}
    .why-icon svg{width:26px;height:26px}
    .why-card h3{font-family:'Lora',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:12px;letter-spacing:-.01em;line-height:1.2}
    .why-card p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--mid);line-height:1.75}

    /* COMMUNITY PARTNER */
    .partner{padding:72px 0;background:var(--cream);border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
    .partner-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:56px;align-items:center}
    @media(max-width:760px){.partner-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
    .partner h2{font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,34px);color:var(--navy);letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:16px}
    .partner p{font-size:15px;color:var(--mid);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:14px}
    .partner p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
    .partner-card{background:var(--white);border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:28px 32px}
    .partner-card-label{font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--soft);margin-bottom:14px;display:block}
    .partner-card h3{font-family:'Lora',serif;font-size:20px;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:10px}
    .partner-card p{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--soft);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:16px}
    .partner-card-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--gold)}
    .partner-card-link:hover{text-decoration:underline}

    /* CTA */
    .about-cta{padding:64px 0;background:var(--navy-dk);text-align:center}
    .about-cta h2{font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,36px);color:#fff;margin-bottom:12px}
    .about-cta p{font-size:15px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);margin-bottom:32px;max-width:480px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;line-height:1.75}
    .cta-btns{display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .btn-gold{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--gold);color:#fff;padding:13px 28px;border-radius:9px;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:700;transition:all .2s}
    .btn-gold:hover{background:#a87008;transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(200,144,10,.35)}
    .btn-ghost{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:transparent;color:#fff;padding:13px 28px;border-radius:9px;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:600;border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);transition:all .2s}
    .btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--gold-lt);color:var(--gold-lt);transform:translateY(-2px)}

    /* FOOTER */
    footer{background:var(--navy-dk)}
    .f-crisis{background:var(--navy);padding:11px 28px;text-align:center;font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6)}
    .f-crisis a{color:var(--gold-lt);font-weight:700;transition:color .2s}
    .f-crisis a:hover{color:#fff}
    .f-main{padding:28px 28px 6px;max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto}
    .f-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px 1.3fr 1fr 1fr 1.2fr;gap:30px;align-items:start}
    @media(max-width:880px){.f-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:26px}}
    @media(max-width:520px){.f-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
    .f-brand img{width:190px;max-width:190px;height:auto;filter:brightness(0) invert(1);opacity:.95;display:block}
    .f-tagline{font-family:'Dancing Script',cursive;font-size:18px;color:var(--gold-lt);margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.25}
    .f-brand-p{font-size:12.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.4);line-height:1.6;margin:0}
    .f-contact{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-bottom:4px}
    .f-contact a{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.45);transition:color .15s;line-height:1.5}
    .f-contact a svg{margin-top:2px;flex-shrink:0;color:var(--gold-lt)}
    .f-contact a:hover{color:rgba(255,255,255,.85)}
    .f-contact .phone{color:var(--gold-lt) !important;font-weight:700;font-size:14px}
    .f-col h4{font-family:'Dancing Script',cursive;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);margin-bottom:10px}
    .f-col ul{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
    .f-col ul a{font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.4);transition:color .15s;line-height:1.3}
    .f-col ul a:hover{color:var(--gold-lt)}
    .f-col .mt{margin-top:10px}
    .f-bot{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);padding:8px 28px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.2)}
    .f-bot a{color:rgba(255,255,255,.28);transition:color .2s}
    .f-bot a:hover{color:var(--gold-lt)}
    .f-heal{font-family:'Dancing Script',cursive;font-size:15px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.25)}
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="nav-in">
    <a href="/"><img src="/logo.png" alt="Sunbright Recovery Center"/></a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="/"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6"/></svg>Home</a>
      <a href="/about" class="active"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>About</a>
      <a href="/events"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>Events</a>
      <a href="/get-involved"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"/></svg>Get Involved</a>
      <a href="/#faq"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8.228 9c.549-1.165 2.03-2 3.772-2 2.21 0 4 1.343 4 3 0 1.4-1.278 2.575-3.006 2.907-.542.104-.994.54-.994 1.093m0 3h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>FAQ</a>
      <a href="/contact"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>Contact</a>
    </div>
    <a href="https://square.link/u/nmGvq3xp" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="nav-cta">
      <svg width="14" height="14" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5 2 5.42 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.09C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.42 22 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z"/></svg>
      Donate Now
    </a>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- PAGE HEADER -->
<div class="page-header">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="ph-eyebrow">About Us</span>
    <h1 class="ph-h1">A Center Built<br/><em>for Healing.</em></h1>
    <p class="ph-sub">Sunbright Recovery Center is community-founded, community-funded, and built by people who have walked alongside recovery for more than twenty years.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- FOUNDER -->
<section class="founder">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="founder-grid">
      <div class="founder-text">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our Founder</span>
        <h2>Built by someone who has seen what works.</h2>
        <p>Linda Spyres, LCSW, LAADC-CA, is the founder of Sunbright Recovery Center. With more than 20 years working in addiction treatment, she has seen firsthand what changes lives — and what falls short.</p>
        <p>Sunbright is her answer to what Northern California has needed for a long time: a small, community-rooted recovery center where every person is known by name, treated with dignity, and given the real tools to build a life beyond addiction.</p>
        <p>Linda brings clinical expertise, deep community relationships, and an unwavering belief that recovery is possible for every person who walks through these doors.</p>
        <div class="founder-creds">
          <div class="founder-badge">
            <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="founder-creds-text">
            <strong>Linda Spyres, LCSW, LAADC-CA</strong>
            <span>Founder · 20+ years in addiction treatment</span>
          </div>
