<!-- PROGRAM MANAGER -->
<section class="founder" style="background:var(--navy-lt);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="founder-grid">
      <div class="founder-text">
        <span class="eyebrow">Program Leadership</span>
        <h2>The person on the ground, every day.</h2>
        <p>Faith O'Dell has spent the last five years working beside Linda — sharing the vision and helping carry it from an idea to a finished building. As Sunbright's Program Manager and Visionary, she's the driving force behind so much of what has made this center possible.</p>
        <p>She's the one securing the donations that furnish each room, creating and running the fundraisers and community events, and building the relationships that keep this mission moving forward. On site daily, she'll be the front person for resident contact and community coordination — making sure that from the very first phone call, no one feels alone in the process.</p>
        <p>Because of her commitment to this mission, Linda says she may not have kept moving forward without her. Sunbright is a shared vision — and Faith is the one who shows up, every day, to make it real. She is also the founding chair of the Sunbright Recovery Center Advisory Board.</p>
