<!-- ABOUT THE CENTER -->
<section class="about-story">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="about-story-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">About the Center</span>
        <h2>A center built for healing.</h2>
        <p>Sunbright Recovery Center is preparing to open with one belief at its core: every person who walks through our doors deserves to be treated with dignity, met with compassion, and given real tools for lasting recovery.</p>
        <p>Our 16-bed residential center in Red Bluff combines evidence-based therapy, faith-integrated support, and the warmth of a small community that learns your name and walks with you — through recovery, and long after.</p>
        <p>We offer 30, 60, and 90-day residential programs for men and women, with services designed around what actually works — not what fits a billing code or fills a bed.</p>
        <p>Recovery is a family journey. Sunbright is family-inclusive from day one — we believe healing goes deeper when the people who love you are part of the process.</p>
        <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--soft);font-style:italic;margin-top:6px;">Every donation goes directly toward furnishing, equipping, and operating the center — so we can serve the people of Northern California who need it most.</p>
