<!-- OUR MISSION -->
<section class="mission" id="mission">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="mission-head">
      <span class="mission-eyebrow">Our Mission</span>
      <h2>Built differently — and that matters.</h2>
      <p>Most rehabs in California are owned by national chains. Sunbright is different. Every dollar — from donations and community support — goes back into care. Not profits. Not investors.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mission-grid">
      <div class="mission-card">
        <div class="mission-icon"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Real care, not revenue targets</h3>
        <p>No upselling, no surprise charges, no quarterly earnings calls. Our only goal is recovery — no shareholders to answer to, just the people we serve.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mission-card">
        <div class="mission-icon"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-2 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Community-accountable</h3>
        <p>Built by the people of Northern California, answerable to our community — not Wall Street, not private equity. Your gift shapes what happens here.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mission-card">
        <div class="mission-icon"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Every dollar goes to care</h3>
        <p>From donations to community sponsorships — every dollar funds a bed, a chair, a meal, or a counseling hour. Recovery is the only bottom line we track.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="mission-note">Sunbright Recovery Center is a nonprofit organization. Our 501(c)(3) federal tax exemption and state licensing are currently in process.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHY SUNBRIGHT -->
<section class="why">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="why-head">
      <div class="why-divider"><span class="line"></span><span class="line"></span></div>
      <span class="why-eyebrow">Why Sunbright</span>
      <h2>What makes us different</h2>
      <p class="sub">We're building what Northern California has been missing.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="why-grid">
      <div class="why-card">
        <span class="why-numeral">01</span>
        <div class="why-card-content">
          <div class="why-icon"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Welcomed as you are</h3>
          <p>From your very first call, you're met with warmth and dignity. Faith-integrated support is available for those who want it — never required, never pushed. Everyone belongs here.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <span class="why-numeral">02</span>
        <div class="why-card-content">
          <div class="why-icon"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Evidence-based and holistic</h3>
          <p>CBT, motivational interviewing, trauma-informed care, and family systems work — proven therapies combined with whole-person care for mind, body, and spirit.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <span class="why-numeral">03</span>
        <div class="why-card-content">
          <div class="why-icon"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Family-inclusive, always</h3>
          <p>Families are welcomed into the recovery process — not kept at arm's length. We believe healing goes deeper when the people who love you are part of it. Community connection and lifelong aftercare extend that support long after treatment ends.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

